            "text": "{\n\t\"code\":200,\n\t\"data\":{\n\t\t\"categoryDes\":\"\",\n\t\t\"description\":\"<p style=\\\";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">在本服务权益有效</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">期</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">内，</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">协助</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">您</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">在</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">挂号协助服务覆盖医院</span></span><strong><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">可通过泰康医生</span>APP/泰生活APP/https://www.tkhealth.cn/查询</span></strong><strong><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">）</span></span></strong><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">内进行</span></span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">门诊挂号。</span></span></p><p style=\\\";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">由于医院通常提前一周开放门诊预约，因此本服务项目仅支持申请预约</span>5个工作日后的门诊；如您申请本服务项目后，能提前挂号的，我们将及时通知您，并在您同意的前提下提前挂号。</span><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">我们将在您申请使用本服务项目后，扣减本服务项目权益。</span></span></p><p style=\\\";text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">本服务项目针对主治及以上医师门诊挂号，不支持指定医生与级别。</span></span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:微软雅黑\\\">本服务项目不提供陪诊服务。</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\",\n\t\t\"packetNo\":\"PK00000400\",\n\t\t\"planNo\":\"PL00002343\"\n\t},\n\t\"message\":\"查询服务内容成功\",\n\t\"success\":true,\n\t\"timestamp\":1780894424786\n}"
